              with the diamond.


01:13:49.064 --> 01:13:52.034
       LIZ: Well, yeah.
      MONICA: You know,
  like you've always wanted?


01:13:52.037 --> 01:13:58.038
LIZ: Yeah. Be pretty great
to see the look on the chief's
face, wouldn't it? But no.


01:13:58.041 --> 01:14:01.065
  If you hate the chief so much
then why don't you just transfer
     to a different department?


01:14:01.068 --> 01:14:03.052
 'Cause I can't escape her.


01:14:03.055 --> 01:14:07.032
She's like a giant tarantula
on my back, sucking out my soul.


01:14:09.042 --> 01:14:12.039
        She's my mom.
        Whoa, really?


01:14:12.043 --> 01:14:13.039
Yeah.


01:14:14.046 --> 01:14:17.026
                Wow, that, um...


01:14:17.030 --> 01:14:18.036
              That must be tough


01:14:18.040 --> 01:14:19.060
Yeah, you have no idea.


01:14:19.063 --> 01:14:22.040
 I am fifth generation cop.


01:14:22.044 --> 01:14:26.037
My grad-dad always
pushed my mom to
be the best, and she was.


01:14:26.041 --> 01:14:30.048
But now she's on my back every
day, pushing me to be the best.


